<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  mbnavadjust_controls.ui - Option > Controls of the navigation adjustment tool (mbnavadjust's
  form_controls, mbnavadjust_creation.c): section size, contouring, inversion smoothing, z offset
  width, and how mbprocess uses the adjustment model. Loaded at runtime by
  src/mbnavadjust/mbnavadjust_window.cpp. Absolute geometry from the Motif form, no layouts; the
  bottom row (use of the model, Apply, Dismiss) sits below the scales, where the form's attachments
  put it.
  Each Motif XmScale (showValue on) is a slider plus a label named after it + "Value"; the
  callbacks set and read the value, minimum and maximum, and the decimal points format the label.
-->
